        "pkcontributionId": 61952,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 67,
        "headingId": 370,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Ovarian fibroma is a benign stromal tumour composed of fibroblastic cells within a variably collagenous stroma.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-13T17:03:08"
      }
    ],
